ntre \/ day centre for older children \/ children in social workshop, in psychiatric hospital or in a special home which replaces the family \/ all questions deal with the way the parents are informed and consulted \/ opinions on the institute \/ talk about other problems of the child \/ contact with child about institute \/ contact with institute \/ some specific questions for every single category are included ( in particular for the social workshop ) opinions working hours of boss, colleagues \/ transportation \/ income \/ educational courses and hospital \/ domestic decision-making, visits \/ general contact with social workers of the socio-pedagogical bureau \/ contacts with socio-psychiatric bureau \/ other contacts with institutes, family, friends, neighbours \/ questions about upbringing \/ styles of upbringing \/ expectations \/ actual behaviour of the child at several age-levels. Background variables: basic characteristics\/ residence\/ housing situation\/ household characteristics\/ characteristics of parental family\/household\/ occupation\/employment\/ education<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"psychology"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"handicapped"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"childrearing"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"family life"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"education, primary"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"welfare"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","va